: 4}, {"beat": 212, "note": 40, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 216, "note": 36, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 220, "note": 39, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 224, "note": 37, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 228, "note": 40, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 232, "note": 36, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 236, "note": 39, "duration": 4}]}, "toplines": {"type": "notes", "channel": 10, "notes": [{"beat": 16, "note": 49, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 96, "note": 49, "duration": 4}, {"beat": 176, "note": 49, "duration": 4}]}, "voix": {"type": "notes", "channel": 13, "notes": [{"beat": 0, "note": 36, "duration": 4}]}, "lyrics": {"type": "lyrics", "lyrics": [{"beat": 0, "text": ""}, {"beat": 4, "text": "[intro]"}, {"beat": 36, "text": "I promised myself I\u2019d quit, but what irony,"}, {"beat": 44, "text": "In just half an hour, it all went up in smoke, you see."}, {"beat": 52, "text": "I counted the cigarettes, hoping it would end,"}, {"beat": 60, "text": "But I cracked, smoked them all, such a silly trend."}, {"beat": 68, "text": "I smoked my last pack in thirty minutes flat,"}, {"beat": 76, "text": "It was so funny, I lost my balance, imagine that."}, {"beat": 84, "text": "The rising smoke, I thought I saw unicorns,"}, {"beat": 92, "text": "The puff party, yeah, I was stiff as a throne."}, {"beat": 100, "text": "[ \u2026 ]"}, {"beat": 116, "text": "My friends looked on, stunned and confused,"}, {"beat": 124, "text": "They said, \u201cYou\u2019ve lost it, you\u2019re really bemused.\u201d"}, {"beat": 132, "text": "I replied with a grin, my smile a bit tight,"}, {"beat": 140, "text": "\u201cIt\u2019s just a flash party, I had to take flight.\u201d"}, {"beat": 148, "text": "I smoked my last pack in thirty minutes flat,"}, {"beat": 156, "text": "It was so funny, I lost my balance, imagine that."}, {"beat": 164, "text": "The rising smoke, I thought I saw unicorns,"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "The puff party, yeah, I was stiff as a throne."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[solo]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "And now I promise, leaping through the air,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "Never to smoke so much in one go, I swear."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "My last pack was my final spree,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "The puff party was my last dance, you see."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}